<blockquote class="ml-2 border-l-4 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.1)] pl-4 text-text-300">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">"You are given the heads of two sorted linked lists. Merge the two lists into one sorted list. It should be made by splicing together the nodes of the first two lists. Return the head of the merged linked list."</p>
