<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Help you set up GitHub Pages</strong></li>
</ol>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">To get started on Part 1, I just need some info from you:</p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
