id-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3 standard-markdown"><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Here's the upgraded version! Here's everything that's new:</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>Visually impressive:</strong></p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Large hero with animated name reveal, floating "CS" background text, spinning avatar ring</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Dark sections that alternate with light ones for contrast</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Smoother hover effects, cards lift on hover, better typography hierarchy</li>
</ul>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>Expanded content:</strong></p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Longer, more detailed bio with 4 paragraphs</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Academic journey timeline (Algorithms, Formal Languages, Java OOP, Degree)</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Info sidebar with location, degree, role, languages</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">4 projects instead of 3, including the portfolio itself as a project</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Hero stat counters (4 languages, 3 courses, 100% committed)</li>
</ul>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>More JS interactivity:</strong></p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Animated skill progress bars that fill when you scroll to them</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Counter animation on the hero stats</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Spinning loading icon on form submit</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Back-to-top button that appears after scrolling</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Smooth scroll for all anchor links</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Active nav highlighting based on scroll position</li>
</ul>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Use these 4 files to replace the old ones in your GitHub repo.</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 py-2"><div class="group/artifact-block relative flex text-left font-ui rounded-lg overflow-hidden border-0.5 transition duration-300 w-full hover:bg-bg-000/50 px-4 border-border-300 hover:border-border-200"><button type="button" class="absolute inset-0 cursor-pointer rounded-[inherit] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-accent-200" aria-label="View Index"></button><div class="artifact-block-cell flex flex-1 align-start justify-between w-full"><div class="flex flex-1 gap-2 min-w-0"><div class="flex items-end w-[68px] relative shrink-0 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"><div class="absolute right-2 flex flex-1 overflow-hidden w-[52px] h-[71px] rounded-t-lg border-0.5 border-border-200 select-none scale-[1] group-hover/artifact-block:scale-[1.035] -rotate-[0.1rad] group-hover/artifact-block:-rotate-[0.065rad] duration-300 ease-out group-hover/artifact-block:duration-400 group-hover/artifact-block:ease-[cubic-bezier(0,0.9,0.5,1.35)] transition-transform backface-hidden will-change-transform translate-y-[19%] bg-gradient-to-b from-bg-000 to-bg-000/0 pt-4 items-start justify-center h-full"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="text-text-500"><path d="M67.84,92.61,25.37,128l42.47,35.39a6,6,0,1,1-7.68,9.22l-48-40a6,6,0,0,1,0-9.22l48-40a6,6,0,0,1,7.68,9.22Zm176,30.78-48-40a6,6,0,1,0-7.68,9.22L230.63,128l-42.47,35.39a6,6,0,1,0,7.68,9.22l48-40a6,6,0,0,0,0-9.22Zm-81.79-89A6,6,0,0,0,154.36,38l-64,176A6,6,0,0,0,94,221.64a6.15,6.15,0,0,0,2,.36,6,6,0,0,0,5.64-3.95l64-176A6,6,0,0,0,162.05,34.36Z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 py-4 min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="leading-tight text-sm line-clamp-1">Index</div><div class="text-xs line-clamp-1 text-text-400