ction goes. Take a photo and upload it as <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">wireframe.png</code>. That's way more believable and your professor probably expects something hand-drawn anyway.</p>
