<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>script.js</strong> — all the big fancy comment blocks are gone, replaced with simple one-liners like <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">// navbar scroll effect</code> and <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">// mobile hamburger menu</code></li>
