</ul>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>Other ideas:</strong></p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Typing animation</strong> in the hero — like "I'm a Student... Developer... Problem Solver..." cycles through words</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Back to top button</strong> — little arrow that appears when you scroll down</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Smooth hover tooltips</strong> on skill cards showing more detail</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Progress bar at the top</strong> of the page that fills as you scroll</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Cursor dot</strong> — small custom dot that follows your mouse (looks slick and modern)</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Copy email button</strong> in the contact section — click to copy your email to clipboard</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Active section indicator</strong> — a thin line on the side showing where you are on the page</li>
</ul>
