<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Dark mode toggle</strong> — moon icon in the nav, click it to switch to dark mode. It saves your preference so it remembers next time you visit</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Copy email button</strong> — small copy icon next to your email in the About section, click it and it copies <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">stevenseed36@gmail.com</code> to your clipboard and shows "Copied!"</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Back to top button</strong> — navy arrow button that appears in the bottom right corner after you scroll down 400px, click it to smoothly scroll back to the top</li>
