<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click the <strong>"+ Add New"</strong> button on the left (or click the <strong>"+"</strong> next to "Click to create a form")</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">It'll ask you to name the form — just call it "Portfolio Contact"</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">After you create it, it'll give you a form endpoint that looks like <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">https://formspree.io/f/xpzvwkqr</code></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">That last part <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">xpzvwkqr</code> is the ID — send me that and I'll plug it in</li>
