p mainly playing video games with friends until highschool and joined the basketball team, just enjoy spending times with family and friends as i got older i started seeinf what reslly mattered, when i went to schooll in 2021 CS was big and my parents thought it would be the best move but with the evolution of AI it scared me but im only 6 classes away from graudating so its fine.</p><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words">i describe myself as goofy caring. empathetic, just overall normal good guy, i like to show up for others </p><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words">i have big dreams for myself</p><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words">things like that, trade stocks and futures while doing school</p><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words">and maybe i should add a pocture of myself, and also change the colors and styke something fun</p><div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-12 bg-gradient-to-t from-bg-300 to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div></div><button class="pb-3 pt-1 text-xs text-text-500/80 hover:text-text-100 transition w-3/4 text-left rounded-lg">Show more</button></div></div></div><div class="flex justify-start opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-within:opacity-100 pointer-coarse:opacity-100 transition" role="group" aria-label="Message actions"><div class="text-text-300"><div class="text-text-300 flex items-stretch justify-between"><span class="text-text-500 text-xs flex items-center mr-2">1:54 PM</span><div class="flex items-center"><button type="button" data-cds="Button" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none border-0 outline-none rounded h-control font-sans text-body font-medium [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast focus-visible:shadow-focus text-primary aria-pressed:text-accent aspect-square w-control px-0 !text-muted hover:!text-primary" aria-label="Retry"