<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Once you get the files working, here's how the colors are set up:</p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Hero</strong> — Teal labels, orange name</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>About</strong> — Orange labels, orange highlights</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Skills</strong> — Teal labels, teal icons</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Projects</strong> — Orange labels, orange icons</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Contact</strong> — Teal labels, orange social links</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Design Doc</strong> — Teal labels, orange part titles</li>
</ul>
